Wall, floor and ceiling casting in meatray/render/raycaster.lua
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two parts of meatray/render/raycaster.lua are derived from reference
implementations published with Lode Vandevenne's raycasting tutorial:

  * the digital-differential-analyzer wall loop in `Raycaster.render()`, from
    `raycaster_textured.cpp`;
  * the floor and ceiling cast in `Raycaster.FLOOR_SHADER`, from
    `raycaster_floor.cpp`.

    Tutorial: https://lodev.org/cgtutor/raycasting.html
    Sources:  https://lodev.org/cgtutor/files/raycaster_textured.cpp
              https://lodev.org/cgtutor/files/raycaster_floor.cpp

